# p203: secrets never go in git (the repo is public). Templates end in .example.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
pings.env
# p200: secrets and key material never live in the repo. This only stops an
# accidental `git add`; tests/public-surface.test.js reads the disk and fails on
# any of these inside the publish tree or beside the relay, ignored or not.
*.p12
*.pfx
